  "solution": "**Concept used:** \n\nBODMAS rule.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n36 ÷ 18 of 3 × 2 + 8 ÷ 4 of 2 × 5 - 5 ÷ 10 × 2\n\n⇒ 36 × (1/18) × (1/3) × 2 + 8 × 1 / 4 × 1 / 2 × 5 - (5 /10) × 2\n\n⇒ (2/3) × 2 + 5 - 1\n\n⇒ 4 / 3 + 4\n\n⇒ 16 / 3 = 5(1)/(3)\n\n**∴ The value is 5(1)/(3)**",
